:::api{method=POST path="/v1/orders" auth="bearer token"} Create an order
| Field | Type | Required | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `items` | LineItem[] | yes | At least one item |
| `coupon` | string | no | Validated server-side |

**Responses:** `201` created · `409` idempotency key reused · `422` validation errors
:::

```ts file="../../examples/src/pricing.ts" lines="7-13" title="src/pricing.ts — embedded from the repo" {7-9}
```

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Checkout
    participant API as Orders API
    participant PSP as Payment provider
    C->>API: POST /v1/orders (Idempotency-Key)
    API->>PSP: authorize(amount)
    PSP-->>API: authorized
    API-->>C: 201 order
```
